# Cloudspire Coordinator: X counts Mounts and Vehicles that entered "under your control this turn". On turn one Bot1 casts the Coordinator and an
# Air Response Unit (a Vehicle, Black Lotus for white mana). On turn two Bot2 casts its own Air Response Unit and Bot1 taps the Coordinator in
# response to nothing: Bot2's Vehicle is not Bot1's and Bot1's came last turn, so X is 0 and no Pilot is made. On turn three Bot1 casts a
# Memnite (an artifact creature, not a Vehicle) and taps the Coordinator again: still none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Cloudspire Coordinator
Black Lotus
Air Response Unit
Memnite
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Air Response Unit
Island x17

